{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "conservatory.talisman",
  "title": "Talisman",
  "status": "active",
  "entry": "start",
  "entries": [
    "start"
  ],
  "tags": [],
  "notes": "",
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "conservatory.talisman.region",
      "title": "Talisman",
      "kind": "scene",
      "color": "#245c62",
      "nodeIds": [
        "start",
        "read",
        "whose",
        "strike",
        "damp",
        "pocket",
        "leave"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "On the sill, in the dust, a tuning fork. Steel, stamped, older than the last refit.",
          "id": "start.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Somebody left a fork on a windowsill. That is the least mysterious object I have ever found.",
          "id": "start.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "pick it up",
          "goto": "read",
          "id": "start.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "leave it. it is a fork.",
          "goto": "leave",
          "id": "start.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "start",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "read": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "It is engraved, badly, by hand, with a knife rather than a tool: A=440. And under that, smaller: AND NOTHING ELSE.",
          "id": "read.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "\"And nothing else.\"",
          "id": "read.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That is not a joke a tuner makes. That is a joke a man makes at three in the morning about the only thing he still believes.",
          "id": "read.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "strike it",
          "goto": "strike",
          "id": "read.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "whose was it?",
          "goto": "whose",
          "id": "read.choice.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "pocket it and get on",
          "goto": "pocket",
          "id": "read.choice.3",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "has.fork"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "read",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "whose": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "A répétiteur, maybe. Somebody who tuned this room every morning for thirty years and never once got to play in it.",
          "id": "whose.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "There is a name scratched under the stamp, worn to nothing but the shape of a name.",
          "id": "whose.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "They all end up as the shape of a name.",
          "id": "whose.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "strike it",
          "goto": "strike",
          "id": "whose.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "pocket it and get on",
          "goto": "pocket",
          "id": "whose.choice.2",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "has.fork"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "whose",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "strike": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You strike it on your knee and hold it up, the way you have ten thousand times, and it gives you A.",
          "id": "strike.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Four-forty. Clean as anything.",
          "id": "strike.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "A struck fork dies in about ninety seconds. You count, because counting is what you are.",
          "id": "strike.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Ninety. A hundred. A hundred and forty.",
          "id": "strike.line.4"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "It does not decay. It sits exactly where it was struck, at exactly the level it was struck, and it goes on being A.",
          "id": "strike.line.5"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That is not possible. Energy leaves a system. That is not an opinion, that is the whole of physics.",
          "id": "strike.line.6"
        },
        {
          "who": "surfer",
          "text": "...unless the system likes it.",
          "rate": 0.94,
          "id": "strike.line.7"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "What.",
          "id": "strike.line.8"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The building has been holding this note. Not making it — HOLDING it, the way a man holds a breath, and it has been holding it for a very long time.",
          "id": "strike.line.9"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Something in here listened to a sound so hard it would not let it stop.",
          "id": "strike.line.10"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "And a thing that will not let a sound stop is a thing that has stopped being a listener and started being the sound. That is not a ghost. That is worse. A ghost was a person.",
          "id": "strike.line.11"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "stop it. damp it with your hand.",
          "goto": "damp",
          "id": "strike.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "pocket it and get on",
          "goto": "pocket",
          "id": "strike.choice.2",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "has.fork"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "strike",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "damp": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You close your hand around it. The steel is cold and perfectly still, and it has been perfectly still the whole time.",
          "id": "damp.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "...it was not the fork.",
          "id": "damp.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The A goes on, in the room, without it. Then it stops, all at once, the way a held breath stops.",
          "id": "damp.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That was not the fork. That was in here with me and it was being polite.",
          "id": "damp.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "pocket it and get on",
          "goto": "pocket",
          "id": "damp.choice.1",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "has.fork"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "damp",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "pocket": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "It goes in the top pocket, where a professional keeps the one tool he trusts.",
          "id": "pocket.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "A=440. And nothing else. Right.",
          "id": "pocket.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "pocket",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "leave": {
      "speaker": "THE PRACTICE WING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "It is a fork on a sill. I have four rooms.",
          "id": "leave.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You leave the one object in this building that would have told you the truth.",
          "id": "leave.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "leave",
      "type": "dialogue"
    }
  }
}
